  <note>
Joining ogonek tail. Uses a dedicated _ogonek anchor; selected base join positions are optically placed, never the detached bottom-dot anchor.
Weight master: 正文半粗：调制指数降到 0.74，不再跟着 Regular 的粗细差走。接合与竖茎持平，开始给内白让路。B 腰明确内收，e 的开口被额外撑开，8 的下眼大于上眼。
</note>
